WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 25h: Esthar cityscape panorama
Duration: ~20 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes a sweeping camera pan across Esthar's stunning, otherworldly architecture and infrastructure

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The camera sweeps across the skyline of Esthar from left to right. Enormous transparent tubes serve as elevated highways, their walls glowing with faint blue light. Transport vehicles move silently through these tubes high above the ground.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Sleek buildings dominate the view — their architecture is characterized by smooth, curved lines and sweeping arcs. Reflective surfaces catch and bounce light. No sharp corners, no harsh geometry. Everything flows seamlessly into everything else.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Holographic displays float in the air at street level and above — information and visuals rendered in blue and cyan light. Digital advertisements and data streams are visible but unreadable from the distance. The technology is ubiquitous but not oppressive.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The camera continues panning. Parks and green spaces are visible between the buildings — perfectly maintained, with sculpted vegetation and gardens. Water features reflect the sky. Bridges of silver metal connect different districts.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The city extends to the horizon in all directions — clean, bright, and utterly alien compared to the natural world outside. The sky above Esthar is somehow clearer and more vibrant than the outside world. The entire city seems to glow with its own inner light.
